## The operator's rights

The Pasha9 operator who commissioned this build owns their running instance in
full: the deployed platform, all of its data, its domain and accounts, its
branding and content, and the copy of this source code delivered to them. The
operator may run, modify, host, and maintain their instance freely, with no
lock in and no ongoing dependency on Anointed Coder.

## Anointed Coder's retained rights

Anointed Coder remains the author of this codebase and retains the right to
reuse the base template, its architecture, and its components for its own
portfolio and for building future projects for other clients. This retained
right does not extend to the operator's instance, data, branding, or content,
which belong solely to the operator.

## Scope

This notice records the arrangement agreed between Anointed Coder and the
operator. It is not an open-source license and grants the general public no
rights to this code.
